  "description": "You'll be amazed what this bike can do!\nWhether your mission statement is racing cross, grinding gravel, commuting or light touring, you've found the right tool.\nDesigned to be a \"virtual road bike\" when ridden with smaller, high-performance road tires\nGeometry optimized for gravel and 'cross riding, and for panniers (up to 40 pounds)\nBottom bracket height is \"road bike height\" with 28mm tires\nGenerous tire clearance (up to 45mm) to take on gravel or loose trails, or for comfortable load carrying\nDesigned for hydraulic or mechanical flat-mount disc brakes (with full length cables)\nBrushed Finish (not bead blasted) This can add hundreds of dollars to other frames!\nMachined Head Tube and Bottom Bracket shell\nWelded 7cm Titanium Insert in top of Seat Tube (strengthens frame and allows 27.2mm seat post in an oversize seat tube)\n142 x 12mm thru-axle titanium dropouts\nBosses for rack & fender mounting\nWelded Water Bottle Lugs (no rivet to loosen)\n\"No Noodle\" design - frame flex stops here! A must for big, strong 'cross riders\nAll frames are fully hand-prepped prior to shipment\n5-year warranty against defects in material and workmanship\n1/2 price \"crash replacement\" program\n14 day 100% money back guarantee",
